---
import ContactCTA from '../components/ContactCTA.astro';
import Hero from '../components/Hero.astro';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const linkClasses =
	'text-gray-400 underline decoration-solid decoration-transparent decoration-1 underline-offset-[0.25em] transition-[text-decoration-color] duration-200 ease-in-out hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current';
---

<BaseLayout title="About | Raj N Gajjar" description="About Raj N Gajjar Lorem Ipsum">
	<div class="flex flex-col gap-20">
		<main
			class="about mx-auto flex w-full max-w-[83rem] flex-col gap-14 px-6 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-[1fr_60%_1fr]"
		>
			<Hero
				title="About"
				tagline="Thanks for stopping by. Read below to learn more about myself and my background."
			>
				<img
					class="mt-6 rounded-3xl shadow-md"
					width="1553"
					height="873"
					src="/assets/at-work.jpg"
					alt="Raj N Gajjar at work with a colleague"
				/>
			</Hero>

			<section class="flex flex-col gap-2 text-gray-200 lg:contents lg:text-lg">
				<h2 class="text-xl text-gray-0 lg:[grid-column-start:1]">Background</h2>
				<div class="lg:text-lg lg:[grid-column:2/4]">
					<p>
						Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, <a class={linkClasses} href="https://astro.build/"
							>Astro</a
						> makes people happy. Sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua.
						Proin nibh nisl condimentum id venenatis a condimentum vitae. Dapibus ultrices in iaculis
						nunc. Arcu odio ut sem nulla pharetra diam sit amet. Diam quis enim lobortis scelerisque
						fermentum dui faucibus in ornare.
					</p>
					<p>
						Arcu dui vivamus arcu felis bibendum ut tristique et egestas. Eget gravida cum sociis
						natoque penatibus. Cras fermentum odio eu feugiat pretium nibh. Proin nibh nisl
						condimentum id venenatis. Porta nibh venenatis cras sed felis eget velit. Id diam vel
						quam elementum pulvinar etiam non.
					</p>
					<p>
						Ultrices tincidunt arcu non sodales neque sodales ut. Sed enim ut sem viverra aliquet
						eget sit amet. Lacus luctus accumsan tortor posuere ac ut consequat semper viverra.
						Viverra accumsan in nisl nisi scelerisque eu ultrices. In massa tempor nec feugiat nisl
						pretium fusce.
					</p>
				</div>
			</section>
			<section class="flex flex-col gap-2 text-gray-200 lg:contents lg:text-lg">
				<h2 class="text-xl text-gray-0 lg:[grid-column-start:1]">Education</h2>
				<div class="lg:text-lg lg:[grid-column:2/4]">
					<p>Corporis voluptates tenetur laudantium.</p>
				</div>
			</section>
			<section class="flex flex-col gap-2 text-gray-200 lg:contents lg:text-lg">
				<h2 class="text-xl text-gray-0 lg:[grid-column-start:1]">Skills</h2>
				<div class="lg:text-lg lg:[grid-column:2/4]">
					<p>officia unde omnis</p>
				</div>
			</section>
		</main>

		<ContactCTA />
	</div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	@media (min-width: 50em) {
		.about > :global(:first-child) {
			grid-column-start: 2;
		}
	}
</style>
